  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>7</mn><mn>8</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>e</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>e</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi></math></p>",
